    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d393">

                <pb facs="0936" n="896" xml:id="pg896"/>

                <head>393. National Security Action Memorandum No. 172<anchor n="1" xml:id="d393-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1962-07-18">July 18,
                    1962</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list type="to">
                    <head>TO</head>
                    <item>Secretary of State</item>
                    <item>Administrator, National Aeronautics and Space Administration</item>
                </list>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Bilateral Talks Concerning US–USSR Cooperation in Outer Space
                        Activities</item>
                </list>
                <p>The President has reviewed the report on the current state of these conversations
                    sent to him by the Under Secretary of State on July 5, 1962.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d393-f2"/></p>
                <p>The President concurs in the general approach described in the report and has
                    requested that the responsible agencies proceed to carry out the steps described
                    in paragraphs one through seven of pages three and four.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">McGeorge Bundy</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
